menu "Ambyte SD overflow on-device verification"

config AMBYTE_EVQ_HIL
    bool "Enable the evq_hil hardware-in-the-loop verification controls"
    default n
    help
        Test-only build (PlatformIO env evq-hil): synthetic record fill through
        the production store path, read-only flash/SD/index inventories, an
        RTC-retained SD boot hold and publish-gate hold, named fault injection
        and an I/O trace in event_log. See docs/evq-sd-overflow-hil-contract.md.
        Never enabled in a release image.

endmenu
